<title>HONG KONG: Chaifa interim net rises 30.58 percent.</title>
<headline>Chaifa interim net rises 30.58 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.13  vs 9.98 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.2    vs 2.08 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs 3.11 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    32.01  vs 24.51</p>
<p>    Turnover		     202.76 vs 164.98</p>
<p>    Company name		 Chaifa Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  December 16-20</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   December 31</p>
<p>NOTE - Chaifa is a maker and distributor of Playboy-brand goods.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings and interim dividend have adjusted for one-for-five bonus issue of shares on September 23, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
